457	  <p class="lead">
458	    The Academy Award for Best Original Score has been awarded at 93 ceremonies spanning from the 6th Academy Awards
459	    in 1934 through the 98th ceremony in March 2026. This dataset consolidates every winner into a single canonical record,
460	    tracing the evolution of film music's highest honor across nine decades.
461	  </p>
