<!-- ═══════════ SECTION 4: ERA ANALYSIS ═══════════ -->
<section id="era-analysis">
  <h2>4. Era-Based Analysis of Winning Scores</h2>
  <p>
    Using approximate historical boundaries, the 93 ceremonies can be grouped into four major eras,
    each defined by distinct industry conditions, scoring aesthetics, and composer profiles.
  </p>

  <div class="chart-box">
    <canvas id="eraChart" height="350"></canvas>
  </div>
