  <p>
    The {kpi_best_decade_str} are tied as the most diverse decades, each producing
    <strong>{kpi_best_decade_count} unique winners</strong>. The 1950s, by contrast, saw just
    <strong>{decade_stats['1950s']['unique_winners']} composers</strong> claim all 10 awards.
