    more likely to win again. However, this leaves <strong>{round(100 - kpi_repeat_rate, 1)}%</strong> of ceremonies
    going to first-time winners — a substantial majority. The category has consistently introduced new
    voices throughout its history, with every single decade producing at least some first-time winners.
    The pipeline of new talent has never run dry.
  </p>

  <h3>5. The Late 2020s: A New Chapter Unfolding</h3>
  <p>
    The most recent winner — <strong>{last_winner['composer']}</strong> for <em>{last_winner['film']}</em>
    in {last_winner['year']} — is part of a broader pattern in the Contemporary Era: a small number of
